## Adding New Restrictions

When you discover a feature that doesn't work due to platform constraints:

1. Add a new `## Blocked: <Feature Name>` section above
2. Include: what it is, why it fails, error messages, workarounds investigated, what would fix it
3. Date the discovery so we know when to re-test after platform upgrades
